!! /etc/dt/config/C/Xresources.d/Xresources.mwm -- AMIX: "Motif (mwm)" in dtlogin's
!! Options > Session menu; /opt/amix/lib/dt/Xsession.wm starts it
Dtlogin*altDtsIncrement:	True
Dtlogin*altDtName:	Motif (mwm)
Dtlogin*altDtKey:	/opt/motif/bin/mwm
Dtlogin*altDtStart:	/opt/amix/lib/dt/Xsession.wm mwm
